  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction: Evrbed</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We&rsquo;ve been in mattress manufacturing for 4 decades and have directly witnessed the impact of &lsquo;one size fits all mattresses&rsquo; on our customer&rsquo;s sleep. Our customers, usually couples, come to us knowing their individual needs are more unique than what the consumable mattress industry can offer.<br>By building for our boutique clients and providing thousands of one-on-one experiences with our sleep experts, we have perfected the Evrbed, our best-selling mattress base ready for your personalization.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Product description:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Modular mattress design allowing for dual comfort, replaceable components, and lasts 3-4times industry average.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The 14\" Evrbed Mattress is a best-in-class design married with premium materials to maximize sleep, comfort, and sustainability.<br>The EVRBASE uses edge-to-edge firm Pocket Coils for conforming support to fit all shapes and sizes for years to come. For luxury comfort, pressure relief, and advanced airflow, we use two layers of 2-inch Natural Talalay Latex.<br>Sleep perfectly with EVRBED, and stop buying a whole new bed every eight years. We can update your needs at a fraction of the price.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Dual Comfort- both partners get the optimal support and comfort for their body and preferences</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Replaceable Components- Allows to flip and rotate layers and make changes or updates as required.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Sustianablity- Evrbed lasts 3-4 times industry average can is designed with recyclabiltiy in mind.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Payment terms: Online/instore/affirm payments</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Other information:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Hands down the best mattress in the market for the price.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>",
